  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the lardons and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the cumin, coriander, paprika, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the squid and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the chicken broth and bring to a simmer.",
    "reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, until the squid is cooked through, about 10 minutes.",
    "serve hot, garnished with chopped parsley and lemon wedges."
